Upstream files that the 2.4.102 build tree changes and 00-06 did not carry (README, Gap audit). Applies after 06,
at the root of the InfiniTime tree:
- const lv_font_t: LV_FONT_DECLARE is const since 02a, so every user of an LVGL font takes a const font
  (Dice, Metronome, Notifications, StopWatch, widgets/Counter), and the generated fonts are made const to match
  (fonts/CMakeLists.txt). Without these the build stops at "conflicting type qualifiers".
- fonts.json: the three night weather glyphs (0xf186 0xf6c3 0xf73c) are dropped from the 25 px font and six glyphs
  (0xf00b 0xf0e7 0xf240 0xf241 0xf243 0xf244) are added to jetbrains_mono_bold_20.
- Weather symbols: GetSymbol() has no night variant, which follows from the dropped night glyphs (WeatherSymbols.*,
  Weather, WatchFaceDigital, WatchFacePineTimeStyle).
- ha_bridge/ProtocolMessages.cpp is deleted: 00 creates it, the overlay no longer has it (6fbe1cf).

